  "grammar": {
    "title": "Ordering at a Restaurant",
    "explanation": "When ordering, use 'vorrei' (I would like) or 'prendo' (I'll have). To ask about dishes, use 'è' (is it) + adjective. 'Per favore' (please) and 'grazie' (thank you) are essential polite expressions. Verbs like 'prenotare' and 'ordinare' are regular -are verbs.",
